          "correctAnswer": 1,
          "text": "Consider two containers $A$ and $B$ containing monoatomic gases at the same Pressure $P$, Volume $V$ and Temperature $T$. The gas in $A$ is compressed isothermally to $\\frac18$ of its original volume while the gas in $B$ is compressed adiabatically to $\\frac18$ of its original volume. The ratio of final pressure of gas in $B$ to that of gas in $A$ is",
