          "text": "Given below are two statements:<br><b>Statement I:</b> Maximum power is dissipated in a circuit containing an inductor, a capacitor and a resistor connected in series with an $AC$ source, when resonance occurs.<br><b>Statement II:</b> Maximum power is dissipated in a circuit containing pure resistor due to zero phase difference between current and voltage.<br>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
