          "text": "If $f(x)=\\frac{x\\tan1^\\circ+\\log_e123}{x\\log_e1234-\\tan1^\\circ},\\ x\\gt 0$, then the least value of $f(f(x))+f\\left(f\\left(\\frac4x\\right)\\right)$ is",
